# 6) Модель данных (Postgres)

## 6.1 Связки и настройки

```sql
CREATE TABLE telegram_links (
  chat_id       BIGINT      NOT NULL,
  wallet_address TEXT       NOT NULL,
  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),
  revoked_at    TIMESTAMPTZ,
  flags         JSONB       NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}'::jsonb,
  PRIMARY KEY (chat_id, wallet_address)
);
CREATE INDEX ix_tg_links_wallet ON telegram_links(wallet_address) WHERE revoked_at IS NULL;
```

## 6.2 Интенты (handoff state)

```sql
CREATE TABLE action_intents (
  id            UUID        PRIMARY KEY,      -- state (opaque)
  owner_address TEXT        NOT NULL,
  type          TEXT        NOT NULL,         -- revoke/share/download_strict
  data          JSONB       NOT NULL,
  expires_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
  used_at       TIMESTAMPTZ
);
CREATE INDEX ix_intents_owner ON action_intents(owner_address);
```

